Bird cries tree crashes and omens frighten Lanka --- Rakshasis find smashed grove and huge dreadful Hanuman --- Sita disowns knowledge calling stranger wish-formed rakshasa --- Rakshasis tell Ravana of talking monkey and spared shishapa --- Ravana burns and sends eighty thousand clubbed Kinkaras --- Kinkaras rush like moths and strike Hanuman with clubs arrows --- Hanuman roars tail-whirling and seizes iron gate bar --- Hanuman slays Kinkaras and waits as survivors warn Ravana --- Ravana orders unmatched Prahasta son to battle
